stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Connecting: source added, or app launched

    Connecting --> Connected: HTTP 200-299
    Connecting --> Unauthorized: HTTP 401 or 403
    Connecting --> Unreachable: any other status, or no answer

    Connected --> Unreachable: request fails
    Connected --> Unauthorized: credential refused

    Unreachable --> Connecting: backoff elapsed
    Unreachable --> Connecting: network regained, or foreground

    Unauthorized --> Connecting: RECONNECT
